    <item>
      <title>How I Built This Blog</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/how-i-built-this-blog/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 07 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/how-i-built-this-blog/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;create-a-github-repository&#34;&gt;Create a GitHub repository&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Create a new GitHub repository named &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;user name&amp;gt;.github.io&lt;/code&gt; where &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;user name&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; is your GitHub user name.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Clone the new repository.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;install-hugo&#34;&gt;Install Hugo&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;NOTE: Since I built this on Fedora 64-bit, so I&amp;rsquo;ll include instructions for that. See &lt;a href=&#34;https://gohugo.io/installation/&#34;&gt;Hugo&amp;rsquo;s installation instructions&lt;/a&gt; for your operating system.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Download a Hugo release for your operating system from &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/gohugoio/hugo/releases&#34;&gt;Hugo&amp;rsquo;s releases on GitHub&lt;/a&gt;. I downloaded &lt;code&gt;hugo_&amp;lt;version&amp;gt;_linux-amd64.tar.gz&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Extract the Hugo binary:&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;tar -xtvf ./hugo_&amp;lt;version&amp;gt;_linux-amd64.tar.gz&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Move the binary to &lt;code&gt;/usr/local/bin&lt;/code&gt;:&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;mv ./hugo /usr/local/bin/&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Make the binary executable:&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;chmod +x /usr/local/bin/hugo&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;create-a-new-hugo-site-and-install-a-theme&#34;&gt;Create a new Hugo site and install a theme&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;In the parent directory containing your &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;user name&amp;gt;.github.io&lt;/code&gt; repository, create a new site:&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;hugo new site &amp;lt;username&amp;gt;.github.com --force&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;NOTE: The &lt;code&gt;--force&lt;/code&gt; option is required because a folder named &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;user name&amp;gt;.github.io&lt;/code&gt; already exists.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Check out &lt;a href=&#34;https://themes.gohugo.io&#34;&gt;Hugo themes gallery&lt;/a&gt; to select a theme you like. I&amp;rsquo;m using the Paper theme.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Set your location to your repository directory and add the chosen theme as a submodule in your repository.&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;cd ./&amp;lt;user name&amp;gt;.github.io&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;git submodule add https://github.com/halogenica/beautifulhugo.git themes/beautifulhugo&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Update &lt;code&gt;hugo.toml&lt;/code&gt; to include a key for your theme.&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;echo &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;theme = &amp;#39;beautifulhugo&amp;#39;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &amp;gt;&amp;gt; hugo.toml&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Start the Hugo server and browse to &lt;code&gt;http://localhost:1313&lt;/code&gt; to confirm it is working.&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;hugo server&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;configure-your-site&#34;&gt;Configure your site&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Many configuration items will depend on your theme. See your theme&amp;rsquo;s README for details. My &lt;code&gt;hugo.toml&lt;/code&gt; looks something like this:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
